WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.997 --> 00:00:21.240
Ben floated through the crowded auditorium at Monster Academy.

2
00:00:23.662 --> 00:00:27.245
He was looking for Winnie so they could sit together at the morning assembly.

3
00:00:28.165 --> 00:00:34.149
Boomph! He tried to float through a row of chairs, but instead he slammed into something hard.

4
00:00:34.169 --> 00:00:37.571
"Hey! Watch it!"

5
00:00:37.992 --> 00:00:39.092
a werewolf growled.

6
00:00:39.112 --> 00:00:41.634
"Sorry," said Ben.

7
00:00:41.654 --> 00:00:44.355
"I'm still working on my floating technique."

8
00:00:45.516 --> 00:00:47.177
He headed toward the front of the room.

9
00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:53.181
a voice called.

10
00:00:53.981 --> 00:00:55.102
Gaby waved him over.

11
00:00:55.122 --> 00:00:56.943
"Over here!

12
00:00:57.223 --> 00:00:57.823
Sit with me!"

13
00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.401
Ben dropped into the seat next to the giant.

14
00:01:03.421 --> 00:01:05.942
"Hey, Gaby," he said.

15
00:01:05.962 --> 00:01:07.503
"How's it going?

16
00:01:08.103 --> 00:01:09.444
Have you seen Winnie anywhere?"

17
00:01:09.464 --> 00:01:14.526
"No, but maybe—" Before Gaby could finish, Mr.

18
00:01:14.586 --> 00:01:16.167
Freaky hurried onto the stage.

19
00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:19.048
His noses were wiggling wildly.

20
00:01:19.068 --> 00:01:22.109
"Good morning, everyone!"

21
00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:24.230
said the Monster Academy principal.

22
00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.352
"Today is a very exciting day.

23
00:01:28.364 --> 00:01:31.646
The humans from People Place will be arriving very soon."

24
00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.907
"We're already here!"

25
00:01:34.407 --> 00:01:35.888
shouted someone from the crowd.

26
00:01:36.909 --> 00:01:39.990
Ben turned around and saw three humans in the back row.

27
00:01:41.371 --> 00:01:43.512
They were wearing matching black jackets.

28
00:01:44.553 --> 00:01:48.555
Suddenly one of the humans turned into a large, furry monster.

29
00:01:49.835 --> 00:01:53.037
Most of the students laughed, but Ben was confused.

30
00:01:53.057 --> 00:01:54.958
"What's going on?"

31
00:01:55.318 --> 00:01:56.179
he asked Gaby.

32
00:01:56.199 --> 00:01:59.193
"They're the Doppel Gang," she explained.

33
00:01:59.213 --> 00:02:01.894
"Moe, Larry, and Carly.

34
00:02:02.214 --> 00:02:03.395
They're doppelgangers."

35
00:02:03.415 --> 00:02:08.478
"Huh?" Ben knew that doppelgangers usually looked like humans.

36
00:02:09.378 --> 00:02:14.081
He'd also heard that they could make themselves look like anyone—or anything—they wanted.

37
00:02:17.663 --> 00:02:19.804
Plus, they had some magical abilities.

38
00:02:24.426 --> 00:02:27.492
gang loves to play pranks," said Gaby.

39
00:02:27.532 --> 00:02:33.657
"They're really "Moe!"

40
00:02:33.677 --> 00:02:34.597
Mr. Freaky snapped.

41
00:02:35.358 --> 00:02:36.599
"Stop that at once!"

42
00:02:37.799 --> 00:02:39.981
Moe quickly returned to his human form.

43
00:02:40.001 --> 00:02:41.462
"Sorry, Mr.

44
00:02:41.482 --> 00:02:46.406
Freaky." "I need everyone to behave today," said Mr.

45
00:02:46.426 --> 00:02:49.868
Freaky. "We must not scare the humans."

46
00:02:50.769 --> 00:02:54.832
He looked at Miss Bungle, who was sitting in the front row with some other teachers.

47
00:02:56.316 --> 00:02:58.978
"Is the broom flying squad ready for the flyover?"

48
00:02:58.998 --> 00:03:00.799
"Oh yes."

49
00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:02.901
The broom flying teacher beamed.

50
00:03:02.921 --> 00:03:06.944
"All of my best students are in the squad.

51
00:03:08.185 --> 00:03:11.327
We're going to fly over the school to welcome our visitors.

52
00:03:13.328 --> 00:03:15.990
It's going to be spectacular!"

53
00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:19.373
"Of course," thought Ben.

54
00:03:19.393 --> 00:03:21.534
"That's where Winnie is.

55
00:03:21.775 --> 00:03:23.436
She's getting ready for the flyover."

56
00:03:24.636 --> 00:03:26.298
Miss Bungle was still talking.

57
00:03:26.318 --> 00:03:33.184
"The broom fliers are very excited to—" A roar of laughter filled the auditorium.

58
00:03:36.586 --> 00:03:39.929
The doppelgangers were making their eyes bulge out of their faces.

59
00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:44.013
It looked as if invisible hands were squeezing their heads.

60
00:03:45.134 --> 00:03:48.056
Mr. Freaky looked up to see what everyone was laughing at.

61
00:03:48.517 --> 00:03:51.900
The doppelgangers immediately returned to their normal appearances.

62
00:03:53.152 --> 00:03:56.293
Ben heard a couple of monsters still giggling quietly.

63
00:03:57.054 --> 00:03:59.655
He was laughing too—he couldn't help himself.

64
00:04:02.156 --> 00:04:05.337
Gaby was right—the Doppel Gang was pretty funny.

65
00:04:06.318 --> 00:04:09.099
Mr. Freaky turned his attention back to Miss Bungle.

66
00:04:10.199 --> 00:04:13.201
This time the Doppel Gang made themselves look like Mr.

67
00:04:13.261 --> 00:04:18.423
Freaky. Ben and the other students laughed hysterically as the three Mr.

68
00:04:18.503 --> 00:04:20.584
Freakys wiggled their noses and danced.

69
00:04:23.772 --> 00:04:25.253
Mr. Freaky looked annoyed.

70
00:04:25.273 --> 00:04:27.594
"What is so funny?"

71
00:04:27.954 --> 00:04:28.634
he demanded.

72
00:04:29.654 --> 00:04:30.635
Nobody answered.

73
00:04:30.655 --> 00:04:35.397
"This visit must go well, students!"

74
00:04:35.457 --> 00:04:36.597
Mr. Freaky warned them.

75
00:04:36.617 --> 00:04:40.999
"If it doesn't, Mayor Hubbletree will be very angry.

76
00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:45.581
He almost bulldozed our school a couple of weeks ago.

77
00:04:46.841 --> 00:04:49.582
Who knows what he'll do if there are any problems today!"

78
00:04:50.963 --> 00:04:52.444
Mr. Freaky glanced at Mr.

79
00:04:54.496 --> 00:04:55.257
Gwarg. "What time is it?"

80
00:04:55.557 --> 00:04:57.238
the principal asked the gym teacher.

81
00:04:58.078 --> 00:04:58.578
As Mr.

82
00:04:58.638 --> 00:05:03.241
Gwarg looked at his watch, the Doppel Gang turned into three enormous noses.

83
00:05:04.602 --> 00:05:06.943
The auditorium seemed to shake with laughter.

84
00:05:09.925 --> 00:05:13.247
Mr. Freaky looked up, and everyone stopped laughing.

85
00:05:14.768 --> 00:05:17.429
The Doppel Gang looked like their usual selves again.

86
00:05:17.449 --> 00:05:20.871
"Why does everybody keep laughing?"

87
00:05:21.251 --> 00:05:22.092
asked the principal.

88
00:05:23.088 --> 00:05:28.049
Mr. Gwarg stood up and turned around to glare at the students, his hands on his hips.

89
00:05:28.069 --> 00:05:30.430
"I don't know, Mr.

90
00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:32.711
Freaky. But I don't like it."

91
00:05:33.731 --> 00:05:37.192
He glared at the students for another moment and then looked at his watch.

92
00:05:37.212 --> 00:05:39.773
"It's 9:40, sir."

93
00:05:39.793 --> 00:05:42.453
"Good," said Mr.

94
00:05:42.513 --> 00:05:47.575
Freaky. "Now, students, the humans should be here in about 30 minutes.

95
00:05:48.595 --> 00:05:51.596
We have a lot of fun events planned for our guests.

96
00:05:52.948 --> 00:05:56.931
Waldo Wizz will present a wonderful new experiment in the science lab.

97
00:05:58.192 --> 00:06:00.273
We'll eat a delicious lunch together.

98
00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:04.396
And our two schools will play each other in soccer.

99
00:06:06.637 --> 00:06:12.001
So please behave today, and remember: don't scare the humans!"

100
00:06:13.142 --> 00:06:18.665
The principal dismissed the students, and everyone headed for the school lobby to wait for the humans to

101
00:06:18.725 --> 00:06:22.048
arrive. Ben floated through the crowded hallway.

102
00:06:23.124 --> 00:06:25.885
"I wonder where the broom fliers are," he thought.

103
00:06:25.905 --> 00:06:28.045
"I want to wish Winnie good luck.

104
00:06:28.365 --> 00:06:30.446
She'll probably get to do some cool tricks."

105
00:06:32.206 --> 00:06:35.547
He spotted Miss Bungle talking to a group of flying students.

106
00:06:35.567 --> 00:06:37.328
"Oh, good.

107
00:06:37.368 --> 00:06:39.528
It's the broom flying squad," thought Ben.

108
00:06:40.249 --> 00:06:41.349
He shot toward the group.

109
00:06:42.169 --> 00:06:43.069
But then he stopped.

110
00:06:45.470 --> 00:06:48.471
Holding their brooms were four witches and two goblins.

111
00:06:49.311 --> 00:06:50.511
But there was no Winnie.

112
00:06:51.772 --> 00:06:52.832
Ben scratched his head.

113
00:06:54.113 --> 00:06:54.795
"Where is she?"

114
00:06:55.156 --> 00:06:55.697
he wondered.
